cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or its accompanying software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Manṭiq al-ṭayr: A TEI–IIIF Multi-Witness Manuscript Transcription Prototype"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/KidoIshi/mantiq-al-tayr-tei-iiif"
url: "https://github.com/KidoIshi/mantiq-al-tayr-tei-iiif"
authors:
  - family-names: Ishikawa
    given-names: Kido
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2254-2189"
    website: "https://researchmap.jp/kidoishi/"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible TEI P5 and IIIF prototype containing 30 Persian couplets
  from BnF Persan 348 and an independently transcribed nine-couplet opening
  from Smithsonian FSC-MS-28. The dataset contains 78 reviewed hemistich-to-image
  alignments across three IIIF Canvases, a non-selective apparatus example,
  witness collation, project schemas, validation reports, and a comparison
  viewer. Researcher review against manuscript images is not external peer review.
keywords:
  - TEI
  - IIIF
  - Persian literature
  - manuscript studies
  - textual criticism
  - Manṭiq al-ṭayr
  - Farīd al-Dīn ʿAṭṭār
